      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a proof of concept for corner case in wear.\n\nThe problem is that `something` is `device discovery`, not `service discovery`. \n\nThis CL completes the cycle for both allowing upper layer to continue propagation or caching of the data as needed.\n\nIt propagates both `device discovery` *and* `service discovery`\n\nIMHO I think it should only propagate `service discovery` just so this info is cached at a higher layer.\n\nI included both for the experimental process.\n\nI\u0027m hoping to partner with Wear to see if this works for them; if so then we can see if/how it works for a larger audience.",
